{"a":[92,92],"h":"<p>92.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"84\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 83.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 32.2 32.2 50.2 50.2 60.7 60.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"50.2 67.4\" y=\"20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> İşte şu-ya'ni şu önümüzdeki millet, bu Kur'an ile verilen tevhid ve islâm milleti <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"74\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 74.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 37.6 44.3 44.3 51.0 51.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 57.7\" y=\"21.0 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> sizin ümmetinizdir-sizin me'mur olduğunuz millettir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"105\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 104.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 32.3 32.3 44.3 51.0 68.3 68.3 75.0 75.0 81.7 81.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 51.0 75.0 88.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ümmeti vâhide olarak-bütün Peygamberlerinki gibi İmamı bir, Şeriatı bir, Kıblesi bir olarak öne düşmüş bir cemaat halinde<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"106\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 106.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 25.4 25.4 37.4 37.4 37.4 44.3 61.4 61.4 68.3 75.0 81.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 68.3 75.0 81.7 90.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ben de rabbınızım<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"90\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 89.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 35.3 35.3 44.3 44.3 51.0 51.0 60.0 66.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"66.7 73.4\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> binaenaleyh bana ıbadet ve ubudiyyet ediniz. -Ya'ni ümmeti vâhide olabilmek için ancak beni ma'bud biliniz, bana ıbadet ediniz 93. </p>"}